# TypeScript incremental build cache
# Rewritten on every `tsc` / `next build`, so tracking it turns a plain build
# into a working-tree change — and, on a shared branch, into a conflict in a
# file nobody edits by hand. Regenerates on demand; nothing needs it in git.
*.tsbuildinfo
